    "created_at": "2020-09-01T15:56:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-09-01T15:56:35Z",
    "body": "The document does not change its browsing context. The browsing context changes. So where the current definition assumes there is a single top-level browsing context, there are now two. And only one can be considered fully active.",
