    "created_at": "2020-09-02T07:50:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-09-02T07:50:24Z",
    "body": "Yeah, COOP currently ignores/breaks bfcache and also doesn't deal well with history, which is broken in its own way.\r\n\r\nI would expect the browsing session to identify the current/active top-level browsing context/document for that browsing session.",
